expr main (as a matter of fact)

let message "Consider using 'in fact' instead of 'as a matter of fact'."
let description "Microsoft Writing Style Guide: Wordiness."
let kind "Style"
let becomes "in fact"

test "We should as a matter of fact today." "We should in fact today."
